  "body": "### Minor Changes\n\n- 32dccfd: Agents pass the version a project uses as its own value, not as a suffix of the library ID. `query-docs` (MCP and pi) takes a `version` input and `ctx7 docs` a `--tag` option, sent to `/v2/context` as `version`; Context7 serves that version or the closest one it has. `resolve-library-id` no longer lists versions."
